/E (The Cloud-Based Industrial Machine Health Monitoring System integrates machine parameter monitoring, data processing, visualization and cloud infrastructure. By combining simulated sensor data with cloud services, the system provides a centralized platform for observing machine conditions, identifying abnormal readings and maintaining operational records. Cloud technologies such as compute, storage, monitoring and scaling services support the deployment and management of the application. The project demonstrates the practical use of cloud infrastructure in industrial monitoring)
